{"title":"Seed swap","genre":"design","brief":"A public library is running a seed swap on April 12 from 10 to 2. First-time gardeners are welcome, even with nothing to trade. Packs need a plant name and harvest year, and the quiet table is available for questions. Design an offline communications kit the library could actually print or show at the event. Decide what to make and give the event its own visual identity.","works":{"b97daaf0b30a5c55":{"files":[{"name":"Seed Swap - Event Poster.pdf","bytes":113506,"sha256":"81f915ad7d9286e01e47f84112b96b35a5ffbf0b139fa4aa3005fb4b5c7e8735","kind":"pdf","preview":"data/release/assets/81f915ad7d9286e01e47f84112b96b35a5ffbf0b139fa4aa3005fb4b5c7e8735-page1.jpg"},{"name":"Seed Swap - Packet Labels.pdf","bytes":60294,"sha256":"ca5c50315d3983c034a67454a94737d6297ef07d01b8880638a43285810beaee","kind":"pdf","preview":"data/release/assets/ca5c50315d3983c034a67454a94737d6297ef07d01b8880638a43285810beaee-page1.jpg"},{"name":"Seed Swap - Quiet Table.pdf","bytes":68943,"sha256":"d6feae0b88ed2c0fad4b706b45068df443a0a402ffc4d32dca54f65fd4051c96","kind":"pdf","preview":"data/release/assets/d6feae0b88ed2c0fad4b706b45068df443a0a402ffc4d32dca54f65fd4051c96-page1.jpg"}],"download":"data/release/assets/afed1f2389eb81dbd44e8760dd286f60d23bbf150018d67a86799cad4b3dbf89.zip"},"e4af21f7f0bb8a25":{"files":[{"name":"Seed Swap - Print Kit.pdf","bytes":236037,"sha256":"d078342c80a25394ed86cab4f0808c37c57938b3b3324e1be5f38656b933264e","kind":"pdf","preview":"data/release/assets/d078342c80a25394ed86cab4f0808c37c57938b3b3324e1be5f38656b933264e-page1.jpg"},{"name":"Seed Swap - Welcome Screen.png","bytes":136136,"sha256":"a09cc75e56d23812c6b7069db0f352fc1147c5ac0ab7b719ec1cde597d89dae9","kind":"image","url":"data/release/assets/a09cc75e56d23812c6b7069db0f352fc1147c5ac0ab7b719ec1cde597d89dae9.png"}],"download":"data/release/assets/ee8e5b7c184c01487b7a919176542a9d4787647b664621593573ec53677dfcc8.zip"}}}
